#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/making-a-doctors-appointment.ts:10
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Practice scheduling a doctor’s appointment over the phone by clearly "
"stating your availability and reason for the visit. Perfect for improving "
"clarity and confidence in professional medical settings.\n"
"\n"
"#### Why You Should Play *Doctor's Appointment*\n"
"1. Learn to request appointments on specific dates and times.  \n"
"2. Develop clarity in explaining the purpose of your visit.  \n"
"3. Practice common phrases for medical scheduling.  \n"
"4. Build confidence in managing personal healthcare logistics.  \n"
"5. Prepare for real-world situations where time and details are crucial.\n"
"\n"
"#### How the Scenario Works\n"
"You’ll take the role of a patient calling a doctor’s office to schedule an "
"appointment. The AI, as a receptionist, will ask for your name, preferred "
"date, and reason for the visit. By responding naturally, you’ll build "
"essential communication skills for any medical context.\n"
msgstr ""
"练习通过电话安排医生预约，清晰地说明你的可用时间和就诊原因。非常适合提高在专业医疗环境中的清晰度和自信心。\n"
"\n"
"#### 为什么你应该参加 *医生预约*\n"
"1. 学习在特定日期和时间请求预约。  \n"
"2. 发展清晰解释你就诊目的的能力。  \n"
"3. 练习医疗调度中的常用短语。  \n"
"4. 增强管理个人医疗事务的自信心。  \n"
"5. 为现实世界中时间和细节至关重要的情况做好准备。\n"
"\n"
"#### 场景如何运作\n"
"你将扮演一个病人，给医生办公室打电话安排预约。人工智能作为接待员，将询问你的名字、首选日期和就诊原因。通过自然回应，你将建立在任何医疗环境中所需的沟通技"
"巧。"

